      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "## 2026-04-18 durable notes - Diagnosed and completed VPS software maintenance on Amber/Paganel host at user request. - Healthcheck summary before changes: hardware upgrade not needed yet; software maintenance recommended. Noted available OpenClaw update, restart-required state, no ufw installed, SSH exposed on port 22. - User revealed a second agent on the same VPS named Paganel; planned upgrade had to account for both agents. - Gathered operational facts about Paganel: Claude agent runs in tmux session `claude`; Telegram plugin via bun is a child of Claude; `openclaw-gateway` for Paganel is managed by systemd and survives reboot, but Claude/tmux layer did not initially. - With user approv",
