      "endLine": 20,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "- OpenClaw update path was investigated; `openclaw update` had hung earlier, but post-reboot `openclaw update status` showed channel stable and pnpm up to date, npm latest 2026.4.15. - Important environment clarification from user: previous SSH work on 85.198.84.47 was for Badi/Paganel-related server; Amber’s active host discussed later uses IP 46.8.79.53. - User preference reinforced: wants concise practical upgrade plans, with awareness of impact on co-located agents before making changes. - Continued maintenance on 2026-04-18: after VPS reboot, Paganel initially appeared up but was silent in Telegram. - Root cause found: Claude started into an interactive trust prompt for workspace `/roo",
